                    <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="A comedian standing on a small wooden stage with a classic brick wall background and a single microphone stand. A bright spotlight focuses on the center, casting soft shadows. The aesthetic is intimate and casual yet professionally shot with a crisp, clean corporate modern feel. Accents of warm light enhance the friendly and engaging mood." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDkciRtz4qg6cgeG_rgC3KtAiLZbASbWPj6XUnIRxajXCwGW31AwmnPAFQWML6q4wi_CjJ_PFyxGA9V4YEfB03P1beKvVe0TeaTRu9ADs3_R28Yfqk25V5ADmRJcQIuVY74aPfK2H50pgUHPBWrYLjmmeGkdBbcRnFYBm4CucpbvwSG3PyfeF4nKt312c5cQQ4VT2GOATFY7WjVnZnN-cbxMcbQ1B41zfi8QMbimA4-1018h01vXt0MUh0x2V5sGyAfy7wBMqcHAOw" />
