                    <img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="A minimal white art gallery space with people observing a large, modern abstract painting. The lighting is bright and even, emphasizing the clean lines and spaciousness of the venue. A high-end, corporate modern aesthetic with a focus on art and culture. Soft shadows and a neutral color palette create a calm, sophisticated mood." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBuN4bjwikuOU2BeBtzp2Sfwxg03lnnPpN4DzPRXcRx65d4LBRXb4ADLSDLpm0yzsC3-PC2BUHIShVS91Yhx3DK3dW8NwPp7PVkCJLQZLGyILA2haZ_wX28gzSUklh-q_RXbD9yIOeITuzr_Umc_gvRV0FwG8_rJnWESEs93ye1J2Gxp6cYFNWL8HHl3G0lflPHup2qqzkf-FIZXHD7JBYT2B9g5hc0yfOWFxsA5EK5W708W_r60n4Wk2bTmChOwv5oqbECaqZmZJI" />
